OL,3,GNEWSAMP backs plan for new plots for
OL,4,Aevicted gardeners
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP has backed plans to find
OL,7,Fgardeners new allotments after a water
OL,8,Fcompany evicted them from a town's only
OL,9,Fplots.
OL,11,FMore than 130 growers in Wymondham,
OL,12,FNorfolk, had to abandon veg patches in
OL,13,FChapel Lane because landlord Anglian
OL,14,FWater (AW) wanted to expand a nearby
OL,15,Fsewage works.
OL,17,FAW had said taking back the land had
OL,18,Fbeen the only viable option. Now plans
OL,19,Fhave been lodged by the town council
OL,20,Ffor up to 190 plots off Tuttles Lane.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
