OL,3,GNEWSAMP backs plan for new plots for
OL,4,Aevicted gardeners
OL,5,
OL,6,FBen Goldsborough, Labour MP for South
OL,7,FNorfolk, said the gardeners had been
OL,8,F"waiting long enough" and it meant
OL,9,F"much more than just growing
OL,10,Fvegetables".
